      "title": "Yılmaz: Failure to implement ECtHR rulings is a constitutional crime",
      "description": "Turkey's continued refusal to implement rulings issued by the European Court of Human Rights (ECtHR) concerning human rights violations is deepening debates over the rule of law and human rights. Legal experts point out that the failure to implement ECtHR rulings not only perpetuates individual rights violations but also undermines the principle of the rule of law and public confidence in justice. Ercan Yılmaz, co-chair of the Amed (Diyarbakır) branch of the Human Rights Association (IHD), spoke to ANF regarding Turkey's non-compliance with ECtHR judgments and the consequences. https://video.anf-news2.com/live/firat/22868199_20261111145819_2026-11-12-amed-ercan-yilmaz-ihd-sube-baskani-uygula",
